### HealthSync Authentication API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@contentType = application/json

### Test: Check Auth Service is Running
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth

### Test: Signup - Create Patient Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "patient@example.com",
    "username": "johndoe",
    "password": "SecurePassword123!",
    "first_name": "John",
    "last_name": "Doe",
    "middle_name": "Michael",
    "phone": "+234812345678",
    "date_of_birth": "1990-05-15",
    "sex": "male",
    "address": "123 Health Street, Lagos, Nigeria",
    "role": "patient"
}


### Test: Signup - Create Doctor Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "doctor@example.com",
    "username": "drsmith",
    "password": "DoctorPass123!",
    "first_name": "Jane",
    "last_name": "Smith",
    "middle_name": "Marie",
    "phone": "+234909876543",
    "date_of_birth": "1985-03-20",
    "sex": "female",
    "address": "456 Medical Avenue, Abuja, Nigeria",
    "role": "doctor"
}

### Test: Signup - Attempt With Missing Fields (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "incomplete@example.com",
    "username": "incompleteuser"
}

### Test: Signup - Attempt With Invalid Role (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "invalidrole@example.com",
    "username": "invaliduser",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "first_name": "Invalid",
    "last_name": "User",
    "middle_name": "Test",
    "phone": "+234812345678",
    "date_of_birth": "1990-05-15",
    "sex": "male",
    "address": "123 Test Street, Lagos, Nigeria",
    "role": "admin"
}

### Test: Signup - Duplicate Email (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "patient@example.com",
    "username": "differentuser",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "first_name": "Duplicate",
    "last_name": "Email",
    "middle_name": "Test",
    "phone": "+234812345670",
    "date_of_birth": "1992-07-10",
    "sex": "female",
    "address": "789 Duplicate Ave, Kano, Nigeria",
    "role": "patient"
}

### Test: Login - Successful Login with Patient Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "patient@example.com",
    "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### Test: Login - Successful Login with Doctor Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "doctor@example.com",
    "password": "DoctorPass123!"
}

### Test: Login - Invalid Email (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
    "password": "SomePassword123!"
}

### Test: Login - Wrong Password (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "patient@example.com",
    "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### Test: Login - Missing Credentials (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "patient@example.com"
}

### Test: Get Profile - Valid Token (Should Succeed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjMsImVtYWlsIjoicGF0aWVudEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiam9obmRvZSIsImlhdCI6MTc3NDM3NDk2NCwiZXhwIjoxNzc0OTc5NzY0fQ.VHNjEBDq9tGVOTUJ8frikDj0Zc94kVrRoTWJgEELbPc

### Test: Get Profile - Missing Token (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile

### Test: Get Profile - Invalid Token (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### Test: Get Profile - Expired Token (Should Fail - After 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImVtYWlsIjoicGF0aWVudEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiam9obmRvZSIsImlhdCI6MTcwMDAwMDAwMCwiZXhwIjoxNzAwNjA0ODAwfQ.expired_token

### Test: Logout - Successful Logout (Login First and Copy Token)
# IMPORTANT: First, run "Login - Successful Login with Patient Account" test above
# Then replace the token below with the token from the login response
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImVtYWlsIjoicGF0aWVudEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiam9obmRvZSIsImlhdCI6MTcxNDAwMDAwMCwiZXhwIjoxNzE0NjA0ODAwfQ.placeholder

### Test: Logout - Missing Token (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### Test: Logout - Invalid Token (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

